{"3232000": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "echo//shredd", "steam_appid": 3232000, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232000/extras/9c9e81b45508dd16937e7d72a487fbe3.avif?t=1768150732\" width=800 height=66 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and your crew are 'Echos,' remotely operated humanoid clones sent to scavenge abandoned stations and industrial zones. Your mission: collect valuable scrap, return to your train, and shred it to extract valuable metals. But be careful. More than an omnipresent gigacorporation is watching your steps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AKAMORI ENTERPRISE</strong> welcomes you to your first shift!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232000/extras/f6299edba5d2c0b9c8893d8bbf6b7cab.poster.avif?t=1768150732\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232000/extras/f6299edba5d2c0b9c8893d8bbf6b7cab.webm?t=1768150732\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232000/extras/f6299edba5d2c0b9c8893d8bbf6b7cab.mp4?t=1768150732\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232000/extras/7e1af1081df5141ed1f6e2888ddbe487.avif?t=1768150732\" width=800 height=66 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with friends or brave the stations alone.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find loot, shred it, and get paid – all while trying to survive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Communication is key</strong> – warn your friends of danger, or leave them behind.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Includes Proximity Voice Chat</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232000/extras/9fed16a40bebd29bba07edcb8c0031c2.avif?t=1768150732\" width=800 height=66 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your environment, hide in shadows, and stay quiet. Noise attracts… things.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are fragile. Stealth, timing, and instinct are your best defense.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use gadgets to increase your chances for survival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be careful where you go. Every step might be your last.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper you go, the more you realize: some things cannot be stopped.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232000/extras/19c4202870c95a7490e3e4d51f31fe6c.poster.avif?t=1768150732\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232000/extras/19c4202870c95a7490e3e4d51f31fe6c.webm?t=1768150732\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232000/extras/550615d70d0454a87f2e146c50df4a09.avif?t=1768150732\" width=800 height=66 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each station is procedurally generated, with shifting layouts and unpredictable dangers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two missions are the same.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The &quot;things&quot; waiting for you will adapt. What worked last time might be useless now.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your only refuge is the train.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232000/extras/df403a039d2fa5434219762caa6e92d8.poster.avif?t=1768150732\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232000/extras/df403a039d2fa5434219762caa6e92d8.webm?t=1768150732\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232000/extras/df403a039d2fa5434219762caa6e92d8.mp4?t=1768150732\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232000/extras/eb7596aa8ab02fd55d44b8e1fa184e74.avif?t=1768150732\" width=800 height=66 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the shredded materials and corporate credits for upgrades and gadgets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Power up your train, unlock tools, and deploy cunning defense mechanisms.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Devices for navigation help you scavenge the most profitable areas.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Repair damages to keep the train running.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232000/extras/ae68e4f54a2c1a21d8abc3e1dfbd5806.avif?t=1768150732\" width=800 height=66 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are an Echo. You are property. You are replaceable. Do your job, follow protocol, and don’t ask questions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your shift begins now. The train won’t wait – and neither will they.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232000/extras/9c9e81b45508dd16937e7d72a487fbe3.avif?t=1768150732\" width=800 height=66 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and your crew are 'Echos,' remotely operated humanoid clones sent to scavenge abandoned stations and industrial zones. Your mission: collect valuable scrap, return to your train, and shred it to extract valuable metals. But be careful. More than an omnipresent gigacorporation is watching your steps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AKAMORI ENTERPRISE</strong> welcomes you to your first shift!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232000/extras/f6299edba5d2c0b9c8893d8bbf6b7cab.poster.avif?t=1768150732\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232000/extras/f6299edba5d2c0b9c8893d8bbf6b7cab.webm?t=1768150732\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232000/extras/f6299edba5d2c0b9c8893d8bbf6b7cab.mp4?t=1768150732\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232000/extras/7e1af1081df5141ed1f6e2888ddbe487.avif?t=1768150732\" width=800 height=66 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with friends or brave the stations alone.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find loot, shred it, and get paid – all while trying to survive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Communication is key</strong> – warn your friends of danger, or leave them behind.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Includes Proximity Voice Chat</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232000/extras/9fed16a40bebd29bba07edcb8c0031c2.avif?t=1768150732\" width=800 height=66 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your environment, hide in shadows, and stay quiet. Noise attracts… things.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are fragile. Stealth, timing, and instinct are your best defense.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use gadgets to increase your chances for survival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be careful where you go. Every step might be your last.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper you go, the more you realize: some things cannot be stopped.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232000/extras/19c4202870c95a7490e3e4d51f31fe6c.poster.avif?t=1768150732\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232000/extras/19c4202870c95a7490e3e4d51f31fe6c.webm?t=1768150732\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232000/extras/550615d70d0454a87f2e146c50df4a09.avif?t=1768150732\" width=800 height=66 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each station is procedurally generated, with 